SUMMARY:Juneteenth Celebration
DESCRIPTION:Join us June 20th at West End Social for a classy 30+ experience celebrating culture\, confidence\, music\, and all shades of beautiful! Featuring music by DJ Jaybee\, Keeva’s Juke Joint Old Fashion signature drink. \nDressy casual to upscale attire encouraged. No athletic wear. No ball caps.
