SUMMARY:Mid Year Vision Journaling
DESCRIPTION:Create\, reflect\, and reset with a guided vision‑journaling session designed for your next chapter.\nVision journaling is like a vision board you can carry\, a mix of pictures\, goals\, affirmations\, and reflections all living inside one beautifully curated notebook.\nThis class is a Vision Journaling Workshop\, where you’ll create a vision board in journal form. You’ll sip\, journal\, and craft your goals and intentions using prompts\, images\, and creative exercises. It’s a cozy\, intentional space for anyone wanting direction\, clarity\, or a moment to reconnect with themselves.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/mid-year-vision-journaling/
LOCATION:Cecy’s 2.0 @ 419 Foster Street\, 419 Foster Street\, Durham\, 27701
CATEGORIES:Craft,Mixers and Parties
