SUMMARY:Pink Pony Pride Run
DESCRIPTION:Pink Pony Pride Run is BACK! Join us and Fleet Feet Carborro and Durham for a 1.5-mile or 3-mile Fun Run & Walk. Wear your proudest\, pink-est outfit as we celebrate movement\, inclusion\, and joy!\nArrive at 6pm to check in\, fuel up\, and meet your fellow runners before we head out together 💖 The run kicks off at 6:30pm\, with music and arts & crafts for all ages after!\n✨ Free to join\, all ages and paces welcome. Save time and register now!
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/pink-pony-pride-run/
